   ],
   "html": "<p>Peacock partnered with IHC to premiere their debut Peacock Original film, They/Them in Los Angeles and New York City. Both film screenings included packed red carpets with the full cast, curated programming, live music and premium after parties with special in-world touches.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Outfest LA FIlm Festival",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>For the premiere, They/Them was chosen to close out the 40th year of Outfest LA Film Festival at The Ace Hotel, to a full house. IHC brought the screening to life with an 80ft red carpet and press line for talent along with a surprise performance from Perfume Genius ahead of the screening.</p>"
    },
    {
