  {
   "title": "Decor & After Party",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>Little touches throughout the venue brought the event to life with branded concessions, a themed photo moment, curated F&amp;B, and custom programing designed specifically for the evening.</p>",
     "right": "<p>IHC adorned the Ace Hotel with subtle touches that resembled the film’s woodsy setting. The cast and Peacock VIPs celebrated at a post reception on the Rooftop, with custom decor and a DJ set by Amanda Williams. </p>"
