  {
   "title": "New York CITY Premiere",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>We then flew across the country to NYC to produce a screening for cultural influencers, horror fans, and select press just two days after the LA premiere. We enlisted the help of Impact to secure our VIP guests alongside film talent.</p>",
     "right": "<p>Notable names included Jaboukie Young-White, Milly, Shapiro, Will Weinbach and Valentina Sampaio as well as reporters from GMA, Buzzfeed, and PopSugar.</p>"
    },
    {
