  {
   "title": "Venue Transformation",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>The NYC venue provided us with a blank slate, which we transformed with warm lighting, key props, and woodsy floral decor including a 10-ft fabricated tree that provided a hero moment for the Peacock logo. </p>",
     "right": "<p>After the screening, the celebrations were in full swing with a custom photo booth, passed hors d'oeuvres, custom cocktails, and a DJ set by Erol Sabadosh.</p>"
    },
